{"server":"cn","storyId":"act7d5_level_act7d5_st03","groupId":"act7d5","stageId":null,"title":"今日厨房","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act7d5/level_act7d5_st03.txt","sourceHash":"b5f6e3f116d0e8548f63613cd46c26f99ba98c1f5d423632aaa60961717d5a6c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"角峰听从银灰的吩咐，单独为崖心准备午餐。\n顺手给前来觅食的伊桑也做了菜的角峰没有料到，伊桑竟也为他准备了一份惊喜。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:50 A.M.  天气/晴\n罗德岛舰船，第二舱室，公共食堂"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"北谢拉格风爆炒绿英菜，再撒上少许罗德岛特制调味粉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！看起来好好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"过奖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"这种绿叶蔬菜在谢拉格很少见，我也很少有机会尝试去料理，能顺利再好不过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"雪境不比罗德岛，在谢拉格的雪原上，许多东西都很匮乏，是花钱也很难买到的。这里虽说是在舰上，但物资却还是很充足，真是难得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"物资啊......这方面的事情，我好像听可露希尔姐姐提起过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是说，罗德岛有专门的采购渠道，定期会有采购人员向舰内运送物资什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"因为在很多地方都有据点，所以就经常能尝到各地各种不同的食材啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得。不过，在很多地方都有据点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好像是类似什么、办事处一类的地方。这个我不懂啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，食堂外面的告示板上不是还贴了心愿单吗？如果有什么特别想吃的东西，都可以写在那上面哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"据说负责采购的哥哥姐姐们会参考那个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小古米的嘴真甜，再叫一声姐姐，姐姐给你带糖回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"采购姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，乖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你正经点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"角峰先生是吧，有什么想要的食材可以尝试写在告示板上，如果有机会的话，我们会进行采购。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，有需要的话我会尝试，届时就辛苦各位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必这样客气，这是我们的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们说话怎么那么死板？大家都是一条船上的人了，放轻松点、自由点说话行不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你那是自由过头了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的采购员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两位别理这家伙，我们接下来还有任务，就不打扰两位了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，大家都是很好的人呢，之前停靠在城市边的时候，可露希尔姐姐还带我一起去采购了哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然她会买些怪怪的东西......不过还是很有意思的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，这我也有所耳闻。之前是不是还因为买了巨大陶土面具，惹那位凯尔希医生生气了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈哈，没错没错，我试过一次，那个面具太怪了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那种一看就很奇怪的东西，就不要去尝试了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，菜凉下来了，温度正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好像有一点咸了，这个口味，可能会有一点刺激......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不会啦，我觉得一定很好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，要不然让我试吃看看吧？可以吗，让我吃吃看吧，角峰大叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"大、大叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（在这个年纪的孩子眼里，我已经是大叔了吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"当然没问题，如果你愿意尝尝看的话，算是帮了我大忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿嘿，让我尝一尝......咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......怎么回事，这盘菜，怎么感觉好像、好像比之前要少了一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好奇怪啊，是我的错觉吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，让我来尝尝看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——唔。啊呜啊呜啊呜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼咀嚼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔姆唔姆。咕噜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好吃！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"蔬菜又脆又多汁而且非常爽口，调味也很清爽，完全不会让人感觉味道很重！哇啊总之就是好好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是吗，多谢夸奖，这样我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"不过没有你说的这么夸张，这种料理方法步骤简单，很适合家庭制作，之后我会把菜谱留一份挂在小厨房，大家都可以试试看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大叔也可以看古米的营养满分乌萨斯秘制蔬菜冻汤！我们交换~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来很美味，那么下次给小姐们做宵夜的时候，就让我来试试看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。初雪小姐和崖心小姐一定会喜欢的~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（大小姐和二小姐吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，古米小小姐，你做好的蛋炖肉排，不快点送过去可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"是给博士做的吧？再放下去就快要凉透了，会很影响口感......不要紧吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！差点忘记了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先走啦！角峰大叔！炒绿英菜超好吃的，一定要记得留菜谱呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"真是个有活力的小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"出来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......不出来吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，别怪我不客气——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可怕可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也没必要上来就动刀动枪吧？说来，你那武器是从哪掏出来的？怎么来厨房还带着武器，真危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你是怎么发现我的？奇怪了，我觉得自己藏得挺好的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"（咬苹果）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"又来厨房偷吃东西吗，其实你完全不必这样，如果饿了，直接去食堂就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"上次的教训还不够？我记得之前后勤处的人员应该有和你强调过，如果再被发现利用特殊能力擅自取用料理或食材，会有相对的处罚吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"处罚？哦，你是说他们定的那个，‘被抓一次就在脸上画一只乌龟’的那个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这算什么处罚，我还以为是在开玩笑来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不对，你还没说是怎么发现我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是你动了我刚做的菜，总量少了一点，我也不会察觉到你的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，失算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来只是想来找找有没有什么早饭剩下的东西可以吃，但是你做的那个，闻起来太香了，一时没忍住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"对不住，真是对不住，我道歉，本人伊桑真诚道歉。啊，还是说道歉也没用？你很在意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，你原谅......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，嗯？你说啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，是的，我很在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"（不是吧，这家伙居然承认了？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"（不得了，这胆量不得了，居然敢承认这么危险的事情！这可是可能会要吃传票的大问题啊！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊？什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"——刚刚没用餐具，直接用手抓菜了吧！而且也没洗手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"太不卫生了！这样怎么能行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚说在意的......就这事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"注意卫生不是一件小事！对待食物要更加有诚心，特别是别人亲手制作的食物，每一份都是蕴含制作者的心意的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你的苹果不会也没洗吧？身为战士，对自己的身体健康要更加负责任才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好，知道了知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"这种敷衍的态度......就是因为这样，杜宾小姐才会总是朝你发火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，这的确不是我该多管的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"别这样，我真的在反省啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"只是那什么，哎，有时候习惯这东西真不是那么好改的，从前我也没这么讲究过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你说错一点，这回我有记得洗手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"只用水冲个一秒根本不算洗手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你也太严格了吧老兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不说这个，不说这个，下次我一定记得行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"真是轻浮的家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，刚刚你尝过那盘菜，感想如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"感想？你说那个炒蔬菜？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"那个叫古米的小姑娘不是夸过一遍了吗，还要我再说一遍？也行，好吃哦，味道超棒，真不愧是你耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有更敷衍一点的说辞吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"还真有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"别说出来，我怕我忍不住教训你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，说正经的，你真想听实话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我直说了，你做的菜虽然好吃，但怎么说呢，吃起来感觉很迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"别说傻话，我做的菜还没到能吃出感情的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，你这人真没趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，实际上是我好几次看到你一边做菜一边叹气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"超明显的。又是发呆又是叹气，真难为你这种状态下还能把菜烧得这么好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"停，停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"算了呗，老兄，你不想说就别勉强，我一点也不在意的，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道你在烦恼什么，但我劝你万事看开点，别和自己过不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你看我，过去还是那个样子，看开了之后其实也没什么。反正看不开我也不能怎么样，还不如不想呢，罗德岛的日子挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，换个话题，我刚刚就想问了，你那边锅里煮的什么呢，闻起来真香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是已经做好的烩兽肉，一会我还要撒点干酪上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"这是谢拉格的乡土菜，雪境人从小都吃这个长大，我有稍微做一些改良，让这种兽肉吃起来更细嫩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！听起来很好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这个也让我尝尝行不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这个不行，这个是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_172_svrash","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这里，角峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷！您什么时候来的罗德岛，怎么也不通知属下一声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"请稍待，我去给您泡茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"char_172_svrash","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，我只是路过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"这次只是谢拉格那边的事情临时要找博士，所以来得很匆忙，事出突然，就没来得及告诉角峰大哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"行程这么赶，老爷也太勉强自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"char_172_svrash","isRemote":false,"text":"比起这个，角峰，恩希亚最近怎么样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐很有精神，病情已经得到了控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"按您吩咐的，小姐的身体状况我和讯使都有关注，以免小姐不适应罗德岛的饮食，稍后我会为二小姐单独送一份午餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"char_172_svrash","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。顺便再热一壶咸乳茶吧，恩希亚一向喜欢那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"口味一直都没变过呢，老爷和小姐都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"是，一切听从您的吩咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"char_172_svrash","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那就这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"char_172_svrash","isRemote":false,"text":"有劳了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"这是老爷吩咐过，专门给二小姐准备的，一会我就要给她送过去。如果你还饿着的话，我可以再重新给你做点什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是，那真是谢谢你。我也想吃那个什么很嫩的肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那是珍贵食材，还是拜托任务会路过那边据点的干员带回来的，总共也就这么一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，烩肉做起来太费时间了，你就用普通的炒兽肉将就一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"过分！区别待遇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"不自己动手的人没资格抱怨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"也对！那我还是赚了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，你说的老爷，就是你们的老板吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"那位偶尔会突然露面，只和博士有话说的银灰老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。你见过老爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"不管见没见过，我劝你最好学会说话更尊敬点，这没坏处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"已经很尊敬了，这不是还带了敬称嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"说正经的，你们老板，我记得好像听其他人说他有两个妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那个叫恩希亚的菲林女孩，就是你说的‘二小姐’吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"挺贴心的好哥哥嘛，还特地让你来做家乡菜，是怕妹妹吃得不习惯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不过怎么都是送给二小姐的东西，那大小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......你到底想问什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"关于两位小姐，这是老爷的家务事，我劝你最好不要多过问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你这表情怪可怕的，放心，我才懒得管有钱人的家务事，我又不傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，帮我递一下那边的调味瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这个？给，接好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不客气。哦，香味出来了香味出来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，虽然只是普通的炒兽肉，但我有调整过配料，味道应该不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的篮子里有面包，旁边的锅里应该还有米饭，你自己爱吃什么就配什么，我先把菜给小姐送过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"吃之前，记得先洗手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧你，你是我老妈吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。幸好我不是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......这就走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可惜，那个烩肉闻起来真的蛮香的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"那就洗个手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"真是怪了，我干啥这么老实听话？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"好，还用了清洗液，每只手三十秒......三、二、一。这样就行了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"（甩手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，这下没问题了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_172_svrash","isRemote":false,"text":"至少把手擦干再抓面包吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"谁啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是什么重要的人，只是个普通铁匠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？奇怪，角峰他不在吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，角峰，茶给我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好香，茶里还放了香油？呵呵，那都是小时候的喝法了，难为你还记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐谬赞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，两位慢用。在下就先失礼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（在茶里放香油，以前最喜欢这么做的，应该是老爷才对。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（从维多利亚回来之后，老爷就再没有这样喝过咸乳茶了，或许是忘记了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（大小姐......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（二小姐这次又把水椒全挑出来了，哎，这个习惯倒是从小到大都没变过。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（老爷也不管一管，再这么挑食下去，营养会不均衡，问题很严重啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说来，我记得老爷从前，的确也会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，打住。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个问题太危险了，还是不要深究，就当做没有过吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂前面的老兄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什么人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我啦！是我！一般看到东西自己在路上飘着那就也只有我了吧！你是不是装傻啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。诺，这个给你，拿好别摔了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，这个是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样，我还有事，先走一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙搞什么，这个是......三明治？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"面包烤的时间太长，也没有切边，里面的鳞蜥肉切得太厚，这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"也别说得这么严厉吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"我看他做得还挺认真的，还切了甘仔片夹进去，味道应该还可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......火神小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，您是来取盾牌的吧，我把几块要修理的全都放在厨房了，这就去取过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我和你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，刚才跑过去的那家伙，在做三明治的时候说了奇怪的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"伊桑他说了什么让您不愉快的话吗？如果是这样，我先代他向您道歉。他这个人说话比较随意，但是没有什么恶意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是。你急急忙忙解释什么，我只是有点奇怪而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"他说‘要让角峰大叔尝尝当代没心没肺青年人的瞎做料理当作回礼，姑且也算是蕴含心意吧’。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"哦对，他还把放在厨房的那两盘做好的菜全端走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"什么乱七八糟的，简直是胡闹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"的确是胡闹，不过，我怎么觉得你好像心情变好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"你照照镜子再这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过话说回来，伊桑他多大年纪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么连那家伙都在喊我大叔啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","aliases":["？？？","火神"]},{"speakerId":"char_172_svrash","aliases":["？？？","银灰"]},{"speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","aliases":["古米"]},{"speakerId":"char_198_blackd","aliases":["讯使"]},{"speakerId":"char_199_yak","aliases":["角峰"]},{"speakerId":"char_355_ethan","aliases":["伊桑"]}]}
